{"format":"hologram.registry.artifact/v1","id":"artifacthub/gitlab/gitlab","fetched":"2026-09-25T12:16:55.395Z","source":{"name":"Artifact Hub","api":"https://artifacthub.io/api/v1/packages/helm/gitlab/gitlab","page":"https://artifacthub.io/packages/helm/gitlab/gitlab"},"readme":"[![pipeline status](https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/charts/gitlab/badges/master/pipeline.svg)](https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/charts/gitlab/pipelines)\n\n# GitLab Helm chart\n\nThe GitLab Helm chart is the best way to operate GitLab on Kubernetes. It contains\nall the required components to get started, and can scale to large deployments.\n\nSome of the key benefits of this chart and [corresponding containers](https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/build/CNG) are:\n\n- Improved scalability and reliability.\n- No requirement for root privileges.\n- Utilization of object storage instead of NFS for storage.\n\n## Detailed documentation\n\nSee the [repository documentation](doc/_index.md) for how to install GitLab and\nother information on charts, tools, and advanced configuration.\n\nFor ease of reading, you can find this documentation published on <https://docs.gitlab.com/charts>.\n\n### Configuration properties\n\nWe're often asked to put a table of all possible properties directly into this README.\nThese charts are _massive_ in scale, and as such the number of properties exceeds\nthe amount of context we're comfortable placing here. Please see our (nearly)\n[comprehensive list of properties and defaults](doc/installation/command-line-options.md).\n\n**Note:** We _strongly recommend_ following our complete documentation, as opposed to\njumping directly into the settings list.\n\n## Architecture and goals\n\nSee the [architecture documentation](doc/architecture/_index.md) for an overview\nof this project's goals and architecture.\n\n## Release Notes\n\nCheck the [version mappings documentation](doc/installation/version_mappings.md) for information on important releases,\nand see the [changelog](CHANGELOG.md) for the full details on any release.\n\n## Contributing\n\nSee the [contribution guidelines](CONTRIBUTING.md) and then check out the\n[development style guide](doc/development/_index.md).","readmeBase":"https://about.gitlab.com/","publisher":{"name":"GitLab","url":"https://artifacthub.io/packages/search?org=gitlab","official":false,"verified":true,"cncf":false},"registered":null,"updated":"2026-09-23T08:22:21.000Z","categories":["Integration and delivery"],"keywords":["gitlab"],"license":null,"links":[{"name":"home","url":"https://about.gitlab.com/"},{"name":"source","url":"https://gitlab.com/gitlab-org/charts/gitlab"},{"name":"GitLab repository","url":"http://charts.gitlab.io/"}],"maintainers":[{"name":"GitLab Inc.","email":"support@gitlab.com"}],"stats":{"pulls":null,"stars":280,"subscriptions":128},"mediaTypes":[],"contentTypes":[],"storage":null,"tags":[{"name":"10.3.4","digest":null,"pushed":"2026-09-24T14:56:51.000Z","size":null,"platforms":[],"mediaType":null,"status":null,"appVersion":"v19.3.3"},{"name":"10.2.7","digest":null,"pushed":"2026-09-23T08:58:37.000Z","size":null,"platforms":[],"mediaType":null,"status":null,"appVersion":"v19.2.7"},{"name":"9.11.13","digest":null,"pushed":"2026-09-23T08:54:30.000Z","size":null,"platforms":[],"mediaType":null,"status":null,"appVersion":"v18.11.12"},{"name":"10.0.9","digest":null,"pushed":"2026-09-23T08:51:25.000Z","size":null,"platforms":[],"mediaType":null,"status":null,"appVersion":"v19.0.9"},{"name":"10.3.3","digest":null,"pushed":"2026-09-23T08:41:26.000Z","size":null,"platforms":[],"mediaType":null,"status":null,"appVersion":"v19.3.3"},{"name":"10.4.1","digest":"sha256:a3f358e70adf5c0504502a90050a45813ff3401ab30bc03d5814fea5c1cacd9f","pushed":"2026-09-23T08:22:21.000Z","size":null,"platforms":[],"mediaType":null,"status":null,"appVersion":"v19.4.1"},{"name":"10.4.0","digest":null,"pushed":"2026-09-17T14:36:04.000Z","size":null,"platforms":[],"mediaType":null,"status":null,"appVersion":"v19.4.0"},{"name":"